#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Nmap"
msgstr "Instalação do Nmap"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, if it is not already installed, add a needed Python module.  As the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, se ainda não estiver instalado, adicione um módulo Python "
"necessário. Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:118
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>pip3 install build</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>pip3 install build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Nmap</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Nmap</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "If you wish to run the test suite, run the following command:"
msgstr "Se você deseja executar a suíte de teste, execute o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/import imp/d'                \\\n"
"    -e 's/^ndiff = .*$/import ndiff/' \\\n"
"    -i ndiff/ndifftest.py</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/import imp/d'                \\\n"
"    -e 's/^ndiff = .*$/import ndiff/' \\\n"
"    -i ndiff/ndifftest.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command> as the <systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user. Tests need a graphical session."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>make check</command>&quot; "
"como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;. Os testes precisam de uma sessão"
" gráfica."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/netutils/nmap.xml:146
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

